<title>ITALY: Ciampino sets up airlines operators committee.</title>
<headline>Ciampino sets up airlines operators committee.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Airline Operators Committee(AOC) has been set up at Rome's Ciampino airport with the aim of backing improved service standards, airport sources said.</p>
<p>AOC president is Eliseo Lanza of Azzura Air, with Gianni d'Amato of DHL Aviation and Rodolfo Lungo of ARE as vice-presidents.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
